<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_tpl_app_apps">TplAppApps</link></para>

<para>This class provides methods to generate and manage the &quot;Apps&quot; menu within the <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link> application. It includes functionalities for creating the menu and adding specific application links. </para>
